		<!-- ── Intro (wysiwyg) ────────────────────────────────────── -->
		<wp:postmeta>
			<wp:meta_key><![CDATA[donate_intro]]></wp:meta_key>
			<wp:meta_value><![CDATA[<p>SDWS volunteers have been busy preparing for the San Diego Watercolor Society&#8217;s 46th International Exhibition to be held during the month of October 2026. Ana Laura Salazar, SDWS will be selecting 105 paintings from some of the best watermedia artists in the world. Typically, we receive 600&#8211;800 entries from 20+ countries and 30+ states.</p>
<p>100% of the artist awards for the International Exhibition are funded through donations. Please consider donating to this year&#8217;s show to help recognize the exceptional artists whose paintings will be exhibited. Everyone who contributes to an award will be acknowledged in the exhibition catalog. There are various ways to donate, and any amount will be very much appreciated.</p>]]></wp:meta_value>
